window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Harper Vale isn’t running—but she sure as hell isn’t staying still. The graveyard shift at a rundown fast-food joint seems like the perfect place to disappear. Until she meets Luka Volkov—the grill cook with criminal tattoos, a dead stare, and secrets buried deeper than grease traps.<br> <br> Something in him sees her. Something in her wants to be seen. But the longer she stays, the hotter things burn—between them, and all around them.<br> <br> When danger comes knocking from the past, Harper has a choice: keep hiding… or burn it all down.<br> <b><br> Sharp as a switchblade and just as fast, this dark romance dives into trauma, obsession, and the kind of love that doesn’t ask permission to survive.</b></p>"; 
